<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443890231"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:37.987"><div begin="0.336" end="26.388" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0.336" end="6.487" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.336" end="4.250">我从来不曾抗拒你的</span><span begin="4.981" end="5.465">魅</span><span begin="5.465" end="6.487">力</span></p><p begin="7.563" end="12.728" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.563" end="7.993">虽</span><span begin="7.993" end="8.758">然你</span><span begin="8.758" end="11.112">从来不曾对我</span><span begin="11.112" end="11.777">着</span><span begin="11.777" end="12.728">迷</span></p><p begin="13.769" end="18.658" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.769" end="14.190">我</span><span begin="14.190" end="15.951">总是微笑</span><span begin="16.263" end="16.664">的</span><span begin="16.664" end="17.500">看</span><span begin="17.500" end="17.866">着</span><span begin="17.866" end="18.658">你</span></p><p begin="19.671" end="26.388" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.671" end="23.711">我的情意总是轻易就洋</span><span begin="23.711" end="24.229">溢</span><span begin="24.229" end="24.914">眼</span><span begin="24.914" end="26.388">底</span></p></div><div begin="29.018" end="55.642" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.018" end="35.396" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.018" end="29.507">我</span><span begin="29.507" end="32.432">曾经想过在寂寞</span><span begin="32.432" end="33.160">的</span><span begin="33.544" end="34.229">夜</span><span begin="34.229" end="35.396">里</span></p><p begin="36.404" end="41.444" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.404" end="36.758">你</span><span begin="36.758" end="39.896">终于在意在我的房</span><span begin="39.896" end="40.626">间</span><span begin="40.626" end="41.444">里</span></p><p begin="42.659" end="48.026" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.659" end="43.121">你</span><span begin="43.121" end="44.305">闭上眼</span><span begin="44.305" end="44.825">睛</span><span begin="45.075" end="45.507">亲</span><span begin="45.507" end="46.326">吻</span><span begin="46.326" end="46.691">了</span><span begin="46.691" end="48.026">我</span></p><p begin="48.715" end="55.642" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.715" end="53.134">不说一句紧紧抱我在你的</span><span begin="53.134" end="54.008">怀</span><span begin="54.008" end="55.642">里</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.310" end="1:56.415" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.310" end="1:05.852" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.310" end="1:02.938">我</span><span begin="1:02.938" end="1:03.391">是</span><span begin="1:03.391" end="1:03.911">爱</span><span begin="1:03.911" end="1:04.309">你</span><span begin="1:04.309" end="1:05.852">的</span></p><p begin="1:08.220" end="1:12.146" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.220" end="1:08.726">我</span><span begin="1:08.726" end="1:09.559">爱你</span><span begin="1:09.559" end="1:10.679">到</span><span begin="1:10.679" end="1:12.146">底</span></p><p begin="1:14.979" end="1:20.047" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.979" end="1:17.461">生平第一次我</span><span begin="1:17.461" end="1:18.062">放</span><span begin="1:18.062" end="1:19.197">下矜</span><span begin="1:19.197" end="1:20.047">持</span></p><p begin="1:20.606" end="1:27.160" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.606" end="1:25.055">任凭自己幻想一切关于我</span><span begin="1:25.055" end="1:25.923">和</span><span begin="1:25.923" end="1:27.160">你</span></p><p begin="1:31.078" end="1:35.050" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.078" end="1:31.929">你是</span><span begin="1:31.929" end="1:32.681">爱</span><span begin="1:32.681" end="1:33.064">我</span><span begin="1:33.064" end="1:35.050">的</span></p><p begin="1:37.050" end="1:40.882" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.050" end="1:38.296">你爱我</span><span begin="1:38.296" end="1:39.480">到</span><span begin="1:39.480" end="1:40.882">底</span></p><p begin="1:43.784" end="1:48.852" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.784" end="1:46.26